  "bodyHash": "DsNZ8HDaPO8=",
  "content": "<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/banner.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-paintings\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings\">\n<img alt=\"Github\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">\n<img alt=\"通过 Crowdin 翻译\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=crowdin&color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n厌倦了过于像素化、数量有限且没有合适选择界面的画作？  \n沉浸式画作（Immersive Paintings）允许用户通过拖拽、截图或提供 URL 来创建自己的、Minecraft 风格化的画作。  \n无需资源包，支持多人游戏，且易于使用。\n</p>\n\n<p>此模组提供了一个简单而强大的 GUI，用于选择你的画作、其他玩家的画作，或通过可选数据包提供的画作。默认数据包可用于快速上手！</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/selector.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p>创作菜单允许你快速像素化图片，并应用后期效果和抖动处理，让它们看起来像是属于 Minecraft，无需过多调整。</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/editor.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p>但如果没有精美的画框，再好的画作也会失色。从不同风格和多种材质中选择，让你的作品更受瞩目。</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/frames.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p>通过智能细节级别、缓存和延迟数据流，性能影响几乎不可察觉。</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/multi.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p>还提供发光画作版本！</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/glow.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p>你的图片带有透明通道？没问题，使用涂鸦，喷在任何墙上！</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/alpha.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<p>以下是合成配方。</p>\n\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=immersive_paintings%3A.%2A&dependencies=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FLuke100000%2FImmersivePaintings%2Ftree%2F1.20.1&resolution=48&animated=False&row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的配方图片\"/></p>\n\n<p>\n与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/joy-of-painting\">Joy of Painting</a> 兼容！  \n只需将画布放在画作上即可展示！\n</p>\n<img width=\"872\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=872,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/joy.jpg\"\nalt=\"截图\"/>\n\n<h1>给服务器管理员</h1>\n<p>\n沉浸式画作需要传输和存储图片，在服务器上可能会积累大量数据。如果你的服务器带宽或存储空间不足，请查看  \n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/wiki/Config\">配置文件</a>。  \n它为玩家设置了一些限制和带宽控制选项，以满足你的需求。\n</p>\n\n<h1>数据包</h1>\n<p>\n可选地，使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/wiki/Custom-Paintings\">数据包</a> 共享画作集。\n</p>\n\n<h1>翻译</h1>\n<p>\n你希望模组支持你的语言？请在 <a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">Crowdin</a> 上帮助翻译该模组。\n</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1>沉浸系列（Immersive Collection）</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-armors\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Armors&description=大量独特且符合原版风格的护甲套装。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式护甲\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-aircraft\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Aircraft&description=一系列用于旅行、运输和探索的复古飞行器！&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式飞行器\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-melodies\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Melodies&description=用各种乐器演奏自定义旋律，来打扰你的朋友们！&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式旋律\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-paintings\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Paintings&description=拖拽、像素化并悬挂美丽的艺术品。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式画作\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-optimization\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Optimization&description=一个轻量级的实体刻调度器，用于加倍你的TPS。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式优化\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/selectivebounds\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&description=在不必要时隐藏丑陋的方块选择轮廓。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"选择性边界\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/man-of-many-planes\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man%20of%20Many%20Planes&description=为沉浸式飞行器提供的一组额外飞行器，并考虑了对 Create 模组的支持。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"多面飞行家\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-machinery\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Machinery&description=一系列用于运输、挖掘和自动化的复古机械。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式机械\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-furniture\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Furniture&description=在游戏中创建自定义且精美的家具，或从庞大的在线库中选择。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式家具\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-gateways\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Gateways&description=散落在主世界中神秘且被遗忘已久的传送门。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"沉浸式传送门\"/>\n</a></p>\n\n<h1>扩展包</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-paintings-faithful-addon\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Faithful%20Addon&description=为 Faithful 纹理包提供的 32px 扩展包。&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/629/725/64/64/638028066470632891.jpeg&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Faithful 扩展包\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/arids-immersive-resprites\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Arids%20Immersive%20Resprites&description=为沉浸式旋律和沉浸式画作模组提供的纹理重绘！&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/common/icons/arids-immersive-resprites.webp&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Arids 的沉浸式纹理重绘\"/>\n</a></p>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=f79ed7591f3496f8580139e47ae744c3\" alt=\"便于页面部署的页面哈希。\"/>",
